nce against  fox he was previously ordered to stay  away from trevino he's accused of  violating the order of protection at  least twice the i-team reached out to  fox through his attorney he declined an  interview on the 9-1-1 call fox is heard  blaming himself for his children's  deaths i did this i  you did not do this i can't believe i  let this happen trevino is currently in  jail facing murder charges a county  spokesman says she was no longer  employed by dfs as of august 5th  vanessa murphy 8 news now  our channel 8 i-team requested an  interview with trevino and did not  receive a response says of air time
 

